- **2026-07-28 — Kaggle tunnel refreshed:** `KAGGLE_API_BASE_URL=https://dial-controversial-lifetime-upgrade.trycloudflare.com` (ephemeral). Verified reachable (2 GPUs). Kaggle notebook pip warnings (`dopamine-rl`/`gym`, `gradio`/`pillow`) are harmless — extract server starts fine. Ensure `KAGGLE_API_SECRET` matches notebook (not placeholder). Laptop `EXTRACT_PROVIDER=kaggle`.
