## 7. Environment variables (`backend/.env`)

Azure OpenAI uses **Foundry v1 API** — `OpenAI` class with `base_url` + `api_key`; pass **deployment name** as `model=`. Do **not** use `AzureOpenAI` with `api_version`.

```env
# TTS + images (edzhub / services endpoint)
AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=...
AZURE_SERVICES_BASE_URL=https://edzhub-resource.services.ai.azure.com/openai/v1
AZURE_TTS_BASE_URL=https://edzhub-resource.services.ai.azure.com/openai/v1
AZURE_TTS_DEPLOYMENT=gpt-4o-mini-tts
AZURE_IMAGES_BASE_URL=https://edzhub-resource.services.ai.azure.com/openai/v1
AZURE_IMAGE_DEPLOYMENT=gpt-image-2

# Chat — separate resource (chapterwise-text); do not reuse TTS/image key
TEXT_PROVIDER=azure
AZURE_CHAT_API_KEY=...
AZURE_CHAT_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-RESOURCE.openai.azure.com/openai/v1
AZURE_TEXT_DEPLOYMENT=gpt-4.1-mini
CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_BUILDER=regex
CHAPTERWISE_LLM_TIMEOUT=600

CHAPTERWISE_CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_CHUNK_PAGES=4
CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_RETRY_CHARS=2000
CHAPTERWISE_MAX_PDF_BYTES=524288000
CHAPTERWISE_EXTRACT_WORKERS=16
CHAPTERWISE_TEXT_EXTRACTOR=rapidocr
CHAPTERWISE_RAPIDOCR_FORCE=0
CHAPTERWISE_DEBUG_TIMING=0
# Skip eager image base64 during extract (encode on /topic). Set 0 to restore old behavior.
CHAPTERWISE_DEFER_IMAGE_B64=1
BLUR_VARIANCE_THRESHOLD=100
SMALL_IMAGE_MIN_DIM=400

# Kaggle remote extract (optional)
KAGGLE_ENABLED=true
KAGGLE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-tunnel.trycloudflare.com
KAGGLE_API_SECRET=...
EXTRACT_PROVIDER=local
KAGGLE_EXTRACT_TIMEOUT=900
KAGGLE_CHUNK_TIMEOUT=120
KAGGLE_UPLOAD_CHUNK_BYTES=4194304
KAGGLE_CHUNK_THRESHOLD_BYTES=10485760
KAGGLE_UPLOAD_RETRIES=3
KAGGLE_POLL_INTERVAL=5
KAGGLE_POLL_TIMEOUT=90
KAGGLE_RESULT_TIMEOUT=300
KAGGLE_USERNAME=...
KAGGLE_API_TOKEN=...
KAGGLE_DATASET_SLUG=chapterwise-models

# Kaggle notebook only (not laptop .env unless testing locally)
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...
# CHAPTERWISE_LLM_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct
# CHAPTERWISE_LLM_PRELOAD=1
# CHAPTERWISE_LLM_4BIT=1
# CHAPTERWISE_LLM_MAX_INPUT_CHARS=12000
# CHAPTERWISE_LLM_MAX_NEW_TOKENS=1024
# CHAPTERWISE_LLM_ASSISTANT_CAP_CHARS=2000
# PYTORCH_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True
```

Frontend `.env` optional: `VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8766`

